{"video":"My-VUirw76w","lines":[{"t":[0,4],"en":"- All right, we're here for Daryl and his band."},{"t":[4,4.9],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[4.9,6.8],"en":"Let's also give a shout out to Phyllis"},{"t":[6.8,8.6],"en":"for this awesome party, huh?"},{"t":[8.6,9.4],"en":"- Hey, Phyllis!"},{"t":[9.4,11.3],"en":"- Probably the best one that we have ever had."},{"t":[11.3,13],"en":"- Nice, Phyllis."},{"t":[13,15.6],"en":"- But the real reason that we are here"},{"t":[15.6,17.6],"en":"is to say goodbye to a guy"},{"t":[17.6,20.9],"en":"who we will probably never ever see again."},{"t":[20.9,22.5],"en":"Now, a lot of you know"},{"t":[22.5,24.3],"en":"that I am an accomplished songwriter."},{"t":[24.3,25.4],"en":"- Song parody writer."},{"t":[25.4,28.4],"en":"- I have done things like Beers in Heaven."},{"t":[28.4,29.2],"en":"- Classic."},{"t":[29.2,31],"en":"- Or Total Eclipse of the Fart."},{"t":[31,33.4],"en":"I love to sing them,"},{"t":[33.4,36.7],"en":"but I am not going to be doing that today."},{"t":[36.7,37.9],"en":"I am going to be doing something"},{"t":[37.9,40.6],"en":"I wrote specifically for Toby."},{"t":[40.6,43.9],"en":"Do you know Goodbye Stranger?"},{"t":[43.9,44.7],"en":"Supertramp?"},{"t":[44.7,45.5],"en":"- Yeah."},{"t":[47.1,49.2],"en":"- It was early morning yesterday."},{"t":[50.9,52.4],"en":"I was up before the dawn."},{"t":[55.5,58.2],"en":"And I really have enjoyed my stay."},{"t":[58.5,59.7],"en":"- Toby must be moving on!"},{"t":[59.7,61.3],"en":"- I'm going to miss Toby."},{"t":[61.3,64.7],"en":"He has a nice, calming presence in the office."},{"t":[64.7,66.8],"en":"- Goodbye Toby, it's been nice."},{"t":[66.8,68.7],"en":"Hope you find your paradise."},{"t":[68.7,69.7],"en":"- Don't tell him I said this,"},{"t":[69.7,70.6],"en":"but I always thought he was kind of cute."},{"t":[70.6,71.6],"en":"Come tomorrow, feel no pain."},{"t":[71.6,71.8],"en":"Feel no pain."},{"t":[71.8,71.89999999999999],"en":"Feel no pain."},{"t":[71.89999999999999,72.8],"en":"- Toby!"},{"t":[72.8,73.8],"en":"Toby!"},{"t":[73.8,74.8],"en":"Toby!"},{"t":[74.8,76],"en":"Toby's coming away!"},{"t":[76,76.1],"en":"- See ya!"},{"t":[76.1,77],"en":"He's out of here!"},{"t":[77,78],"en":"See ya!"},{"t":[78,79],"en":"He's out of here!"},{"t":[79,79.8],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[89.2,90.4],"en":"- Goodbye Toby!"},{"t":[90.4,110.4],"en":"Goodbye Toby, goodbye Toby, goodbye Toby, goodbye Toby."},{"t":[120.4,131.3],"en":"Thank you."}]}
